"""Package purpose: The `workspace` Coder template payload.

`main.tf` and `coder.tf` are the Terraform the Coder template runs; the `.tftpl` files are the
`coder_script` bodies rendered with `templatefile()`, and `grok-config.toml.tftpl` plus
`settings.json.tftpl` are the seeded dotfiles. `scripts/push-template.sh` pushes this tree and
globs `*.tf` inside it, so the tree is addressed as one group.

Keep the twin in mind: `templates/devcontainer/` holds an independent copy of these payload
files by design, and both twins are edited together (AGENTS.md).
"""

package(default_visibility = ["//visibility:public"])

filegroup(
    name = "payload",
    srcs = [".terraform.lock.hcl"] + glob(
        [
            "*.tf",
            "*.tftpl",
        ],
        allow_empty = True,
    ),
)
